ting each other with smiles","illustrator":"Rajeev Verma 'Banjara'","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":7,"title":"Five men on a sofa and a girl","illustrator":"Rajeev Verma 'Banjara'","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":8,"title":"Four women and a girl","illustrator":"Rajeev Verma 'Banjara'","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":9,"title":"Lots of children playing together","illustrator":"Rajeev Verma 'Banjara'","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":10,"title":"Children playing together","illustrator":"Rajeev Verma 'Banjara'","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":11,"title":"A family photo","illustrator":"Rajeev Verma 'Banjara'","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":12,"title":"A girl and a barking dog","illustrator":"Rajeev Verma 'Banjara'","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p01.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಹೆಸರು ಟುಕ್ ಟುಕ್.","ನನ್ನದು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕುಟುಂಬ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಇವರು ನನ್ನ ತಾಯಿ, ಇವರು ನನ್ನ ತಂದೆ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಸೋದರ ನೀತು ಮತ್ತು ನನ್ನ ಸೋದರಿ ಮೀತು.","ಜೊತೆಗೆ ನೋಡಿ..."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಈಗ ನನ್ನ ಅಪ್ಪನ ಅಪ್ಪ-ಅಮ್ಮ, ಅಮ್ಮನ ಅಪ್ಪ-ಅಮ್ಮ ಕೂಡ ಬಂದಿದ್ದಾರೆ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಅಮ್ಮನಿಗೆ ಮೂರು ಜನ ಸೋದರಿಯರು.","ನಾನು ಅವರನ್ನು ಚಿಕ್ಕಮ್ಮ ಎಂದು ಕರೆಯುತ್ತೇನೆ. ಜೊತೆಗೆ ನೋಡಿ..."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಅಪ್ಪನಿಗೆ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಜನ ಸೋದರರು.","ನಾನು ಅವರನ್ನು ದೊಡ್ಡಪ್ಪ ಮತ್ತು ಚಿಕ್ಕಪ್ಪ ಎಂದು ಕರೆಯುತ್ತೇನೆ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನನಗೆ ಇಬ್ಬರು ದೊಡ್ಡಮ್ಮ, ಇಬ್ಬರು ಚಿಕ್ಕಮ್ಮ ಇದ್ದಾರೆ.","ನೋಡಿ, ನೋಡಿ, ನೋಡಿ..."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಕುಟುಂಬದಲ್ಲಿ ಐದು ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಇದ್ದಾರೆ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನಾವೆಲ್ಲ ಸೇರಿ ಆಟ ಆಡುವಾಗ ಗದ್ದಲವೋ ಗದ್ದಲ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನೋಡಿ, ಎಷ್ಟು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕುಟುಂಬ ನನ್ನದು!"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456351-nanna-kutumba/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅರೆ, ಅರೆ!! ಬುಜೋ ಕೂಡ ನನ್ನ ಕುಟುಂಬಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿದ್ದು.","ದಿನ ಪೂರ್ತಿ ತನ್ನ ಪುಟ್ಟ ಬಾಲವನ್ನು ಅಲ್ಲಾಡಿಸುತ್ತ ಬೊಗಳುತ್ತೆ...","ಬೌ!! ಬೌ!! ಬೌ!!"]}],"wordCount":97}